st-flowing stream dominated by medium- to large-sized boulders, and rarely, sand and small gravel (Fig. 3). Riparian vegetation comprised of shrubs and small trees along the banks, and small to larger trees along the adjacent hills. Co-occurring fishes include members of the genus Schizothorax, Garra, Opsarius, Devario, Danio, Aborichthys, Psilorhynchus, Amblyceps, Pseudecheneis, and Exostoma.","","text","",""]]},"RGCYC":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"RKWD":{"d":[["Croatia","48518","mrgid","",""]]},"SB2GJ":{"d":[["Afrotropic","","text","native",""]]},"SLRG":{"d":[["USA","","text","",""]]},"SNW8H":{"d":[["Canadian part of the North Atlantic Ocean","25356","mrgid","native",""]]},"SPJK":{"d":[["Southern Asia","","text","",""]]},"T5K8L":{"d":[["New Zealand Exclusive Economic Zone","8455","mrgid","native",""]]},"TMMJ":{"d":[["Cuba","","text","",""]]},"TY5V":{"d":[["Bolivia (Cochabamba, La Paz, Oruro, Potosí); Argentina (Jujuy, Salta); Chile (Arica y Parinacota, Tarapacá, Antofagasta)","","text","",""]]},"V4Z4":{"d":[["Monaco","2222","mrgid","",""]]},"V8TTB":{"d":[["Geographical distribution. Guizhou Province, China.","","text","",""]]},"V9FMV":{"d":[["Global","","text","native","least concern"]]},"V9FN5":{"d":[["Global","","text","native","data deficient"]]},"VC537":{"d":[["Middle America","","text","",""]]},"VKKL":{"d":[["S-India (Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Kerala); Sri Lanka","","text","",""]]},"WDVG":{"d":[["New Zealand (Snares Is.)","","text","",""]]},"WSWW":{"d":[["Neotropical(Argentina, Brazil:Minas Gerais, Paraguay)","","text","",""]]},"X2WW":{"d":[["Campbell I.","","text","native",""]]},"X36W":{"d":[["QLD","QLD","tdwg","",""]]},"XTS9":{"d":[["India","","text","",""]]},"YFLM":{"d":[["Mauritius; Mauritius Island","","text","native",""]]},"ZNXX":{"d":[["","ZAI","tdwg","",""]]}}